==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] (1,800%) spawn, delay 0.67~20 seconds<sup>20f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.67~20 seconds<sup>20f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
**2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**12 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 2.67~5.33 seconds<sup>80f~160f</sup>.
**24 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 1.33~2.67 seconds<sup>40f~80f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage will challenge you to burst down the Sir Rels without dying, along with quite a few Shy Boys, making everything push very hard. [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] if you have them are a great option for dealing with the Sir Rels, especially when Talented. Stacking them at the beginning is highly recommended. If you don't have them, stack ranged attackers and Area attackers to deal with them instead.

